<div class="container mt-5 text-center">
    <h1>About Us</h1>
    <p>
       Art Gallery is recognized as one of the rapidly growing art galleries in Pakistan. The gallery was established in 2025 and has achieved great progress, becoming one of the favorite places for artists and art lovers in a very short period. We are committed to offering high-quality artwork from new and senior professional artists in Pakistan. We also organize and conduct personal and group exhibitions and actively participate in art events across the country to promote art and artists. We encourage everyone to view items on our website and visit our gallery; you’re sure to find something you like, whether an addition to your collection or a gift for a friend or family member—a true feast and treat for collectors!
    </p>

    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>
        The Art Gallery exists to exhibit, interpret, preserve, and promote the visual, artistic, and cultural heritage of Indigenous Peoples of Pakistan; to educate and engage the public on local, regional, and global social issues through the visual arts. The mission of the Oyster Art Gallery is to encourage appreciation and understanding of art and its role in society through direct engagement with original works of art. The gallery acquires, preserves, interprets, exhibits, and makes accessible works of art for the benefit of diverse audiences, supporting interdisciplinary educational goals and benefiting the community at large.
    </p>
    <ul class="text-start">
        <li>Provide a high-quality source of visual art.</li>
        <li>Create an exciting venue where artists can exhibit and sell their art.</li>
        <li>Represent and promote the work of our artists through our gallery, website, workshops, and more.</li>
        <li>Facilitate marketing consulting for artists.</li>
        <li>Offer exhibitions and workshops in an inclusive setting, inspiring and educating people of all ages and abilities.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        We are dedicated to bringing joy and beauty to art collectors. With a fine ensemble of artists, we offer paintings and sculptures that enhance your life and touch your heart. It is our wish to fulfill your art desires with unique and inspirational creations. We welcome you here!
    </p>

    <h2>Our Vision</h2>
    <p>
        We envision a gallery accessible to everyone as a vibrant public space serving the community. Oyster Art Gallery aims to foster greater social engagement, critical thinking, and creativity, enriching the lives of residents and visitors while becoming a leader in art appreciation and interdisciplinary education.
    </p>

    <h2>Our Values</h2>
    <ul class="text-start">
        <li>Develop community responsibility by designing programs that inspire, challenge, educate, and entertain while recognizing excellence in the visual arts.</li>
        <li>Develop professional responsibility by employing curatorial expertise to implement exhibitions, programs, and services in line with nationally recognized professional standards.</li>
        <li>Promote understanding of art’s complex role in reflecting and affecting how people relate critically and creatively to a changing world.</li>
        <li>Present thoughtfully curated exhibitions supported by events and publications that contribute to their fields and gain respect from local, national, and international audiences.</li>
        <li>Take a leadership role in developing educational activities that deepen an understanding of art galleries' roles in producing meaning and advancing knowledge.</li>
        <li>Provide a platform for interdisciplinary thinking and research where ideas and practices can be explored.</li>
        <li>Document the work of the gallery as an accessible resource for current and future art critics and students.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        In pursuit of its mission, the Oyster Art Gallery is committed to the principles of artistic and academic freedom, recognizing the unique relationship between the gallery and its audiences.
    </p>
</div>
